    "summary": "Village woman’s underdress made of cream coloured handwoven linen. The sleeves have red and blue selvedge stripes. The chest panel is lightly embroidered with cross stitch and satin in burgundy, red and green coloured floss silk. The collar is made of red and white Syrian silk ikat. The neck opening is trimmed with braided yellow coloured silk cord which has been used to create loops for the green coloured braided buttons for closure at the collar.",
